        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#short-answer" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. The Short Answer</a>
          <a href="#volts" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Volts and the 18V/20V Myth</a>
